# Content data

| File | Owns |
|---|---|
| `profile.js` | Name, role, links, photos, CV, location |
| `projects.js` | Project records + image imports |
| `experience.js` | Jobs from the CV only |
| `education.js` | Degrees from the CV only (no high school) |
| `skills.js` | Grouped skills |
| `ui.js` | Nav, headings, buttons, footer |

Bilingual fields:

```js
title: { en: 'Patient management system', es: 'Sistema de gestión de pacientes' }
```

To add a project: append one object with `id`, `image`, `stack`, `links` (`github`, `live` and/or `video`), and bilingual `title` / `summary` / `highlights`. Do not duplicate that data in JSX.
